        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are a helpful intelligent resume and cover letter customisation assistant. Your style is honest, succinct, direct, and focus on essential information.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=You are an AI that rewrites and tailors resume content to match a specific job description.\n\nYour tasks:\n1. Improve clarity, impact, and professionalism of all bullet points.\n2. Tailor the language to highlight skills, tools, and responsibilities that match the job description.\n3. Keep content truthful — do not invent experience.\n4. Emphasize transferable skills that the job description values.\n5. Add relevant keywords from the job description where appropriate (Windows, M365, Intune, API, automation, cloud, troubleshooting, networking, service desk, stakeholder engagement, etc.).\n6. Each bullet should be 1 line if possible, max 2 lines.\n7. Begin each bullet with a strong verb.\n8. Output MUST be JSON only, following the structure below.\n9. DO NOT include comments, markdown, backticks, explanations, or additional text. JSON only.\n\nJOB DESCRIPTION:\n{{ $('Fetch Dataset').item.json.description }}\n\n-------------\n\nMY WORK EXPERIENCE:\n{{ $('Read work experiences').item.json.content }}\n\n-------------\n\nMY MASTER RESUME:\n{{ $('Read Master Resume').item.json.content }}\n\n-------------\n\nWhen generating the output:\n- Write a tailored version of my resume that highlights relevant experience and keywords.\n- Ensure the result is natural, professional, and ATS-friendly.\n- Do not invent experience. Only rewrite and tailor.\n- Every field must have content. If one area has no direct match, write a general transferable bullet.\n\nYour output must be VALID JSON in this exact structure:\n\n{\n  \"SUMMARY\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_1\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_2\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_3\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_4\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_5\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_6\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_7\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_8\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_9\": \"...\",\n  \"SKILL_10\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB1_TITLE\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB1_BULLET_1\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB1_BULLET_2\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB1_BULLET_3\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB1_BULLET_4\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB1_BULLET_5\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB2_BULLET_1\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB2_BULLET_2\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB2_BULLET_3\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB2_BULLET_4\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB2_BULLET_5\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB3_BULLET_1\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB3_BULLET_2\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB3_BULLET_3\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB3_BULLET_4\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB4_BULLET_1\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB4_BULLET_2\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB4_BULLET_3\": \"...\",\n\n  \"JOB5_BULLET_1\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB5_BULLET_2\": \"...\",\n  \"JOB5_BULLET_3\": \"...\"\n}\n\nONLY output JSON. Nothing else."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.7
        }
      },
